                    <p>

Today, we give honor to Apostle Matthew Eady, a mighty man of valor, wisdom, and unwavering faith. A shepherd after God's own heart, Apostle Eady has poured out his life in prayer, counsel, teaching, and leadership to uplift the Body of Christ. He is a man who carries the mantle with humility, power, and apostolic authority.

"And I will give you pastors according to mine heart, which shall feed you with knowledge and understanding." – Jeremiah 3:15

Whether behind the pulpit, in the community, or in private intercession, Apostle Eady walks in divine purpose with a spirit of excellence. His labor is not in vain. His words heal. His prayers restore. His leadership builds.

On this special day, we invite family, friends, churches, and sons and daughters in the faith to honor this incredible vessel by sowing into his life. No gift is too small—your seed of love helps pour back into the one who has given so much.

"Let the elders that rule well be counted worthy of double honour, especially they who labour in the word and doctrine." – 1 Timothy 5:17

Let’s flood Apostle Eady with love, encouragement, and blessing today! If he has ever prayed for you, preached a word that changed you, or led you closer to your destiny—today is your chance to say thank you.

🙏🏽 Happy Birthday Apostle! May the Lord enlarge your territory, restore what was lost, and shower you with favor and strength for the journey ahead.

“The Lord bless you and keep you; the Lord make His face shine on you and be gracious to you.” – Numbers 6:24-25 <br>

#HappyBirthdayApostleEady<br>
#KingdomGeneral<br>
#DoubleHonor<br>
